      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.2&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.4&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
